OL,3,AI had to crawl on my hands and knees to
OL,4,Aget off train, says disabled woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wheelchair user was left in tears as
OL,7,Fshe crawled on her "hands and knees"
OL,8,Fthrough a train after being told a ramp
OL,9,Fcould not be used to help her off.
OL,11,FPhoebe Tesoriere, 24, who lived in
OL,12,FCaerphilly at the time, was on a Great
OL,13,FWestern Railway (GWR) train from London
OL,14,FPaddington to Bath Spa when it
OL,15,Fhappened.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
