OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AI had to crawl on my hands and knees to
OL,4,Aget off train, says disabled woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family spoke to the assistance desk
OL,7,Fand were taken to the only designated
OL,8,Fwheelchair space on the train. Phoebe
OL,9,Fsaid she was assured a ramp and
OL,10,Fassistance would be waiting, but was
OL,11,Ftold she was in a carriage beyond the
OL,12,Fplatform and could not get off.
OL,14,FGWR said it was "really sorry" and
OL,15,Fadmitted "we let her down, both when we
OL,16,Fhelped her board and at several points
OL,17,Fduring her journey".
